@cc [owner:spolu,label:architecture] website-static-portability
The website MUST work as static files at both a domain root and a repository subpath, without a
build step or runtime service. Local asset URLs MUST be relative.

@cc [owner:spolu,label:product] website-verification-claims
Website examples MUST match the shared skill and review actions. Illustrative review output MUST
be identified as an example; interactions MUST NOT imply that a review has actually run.
Syntax validation MUST NOT be presented as verification of contract compliance.

@cc [owner:spolu,label:accessibility] website-progressive-interactions
The pitch, default contract example, setup instructions, and grammar MUST remain readable without
JavaScript. Interactive controls MUST be keyboard accessible. Copy controls MUST report success
only after a successful clipboard write and offer manual selection when copying fails.
